try:
 db.execute('INSERT INTO idem(key, user_id, resp) VALUES (%s,%s,%s)', [k, uid, '{}'])
 process_payment()
except UniqueViolation:
 return stored_response(k)

Use generated tsvector column combining name plus description with weights and GIN index for fast lookup and relevance. Update via trigger on insert update to keep vector fresh. Query with plainto_tsquery plus ts_rank_cd for ranking and ts_headline for highlights. Support pagination with keyset on rank plus id and filter by category. Handle stopwords and unaccent via extension for better recall. Test relevance with curated queries asserting top result and measure P95 latency. Expose search endpoint with limit validation and logging of zero result queries for tuning. Add dictionary customization for domain synonyms. This delivers quality search without external service for mid scale catalogs today. Code:
ALTER TABLE products ADD COLUMN tsv tsvector GENERATED ALWAYS AS (to_tsvector('english', name || ' ' || description)) STORED;
CREATE INDEX idx_ptsv ON products USING GIN(tsv);
